{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>香港天文台於2026年11月14日凌晨2時45分發出特別天氣提示，預計未來兩至三小時內，香港廣泛地區可能受大雨影響。市民應提高警覺，密切留意最新天氣資訊。\n</p>\n<p>天文台提醒市民，強降雨可能導致低窪地區出現水浸情況，外出時請注意安全，避免前往容易受水浸影響的地區。此外，駕駛人士應小心路面濕滑，減速行駛以確保安全。</p>\n<p>市民可透過天文台網站或手機應用程式獲取最新天氣更新，並採取必要的防範措施以應對可能的惡劣天氣。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a7%e9%9b%a8%e8%ad%a6%e5%91%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大雨警告</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 14 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T19:06:32.732835+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":239,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T18:45:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T22:42:30.287447+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T18:59:50.582365+00:00","content_hash":"94ca71a9d7e981755cedbe5f1a875e494c1e0d8422097d8bc9af22a5f21124d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}